{"created": "2026-10-11T12:07:51.603038+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-11T12:07:52.181222+00:00", "id": 23297810, "conceptrecid": "23297809", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23297809", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "metadata": {"title": "A 34-term unit-fraction expansion with minimum denominator 18", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "publication_date": "2026-10-11", "description": "<p>This note gives an explicit expansion of 1 as a sum of 34 distinct unit fractions whose denominators are all at least 18, proving k(18) &lt;= 34. Exact rational and integer arithmetic verifies the certificate. A reproduced exhaustive search excludes at most 32 terms, giving 33 &lt;= k(18) &lt;= 34; the 33-term case remains open.</p>\n<p>The note, denominator list, standalone verifier, search sources, and completed search logs are included. The construction replaces five terms of the 35-term witness reported by Patrick White and Claude in their study of Erdos problem #295 with four terms. Source: https://erdosproblemaday.com/day/295-k17-exact</p>\n<p>Research initiated by Kyunghan Bae. OpenAI Codex (GPT-6 session) agents developed the search and verification code, found the construction, performed exact arithmetic checks, and assisted in preparing the note.</p>\n<p>Repository: https://github.com/qorud02/erdos-295-k18<br>The research note and documentation use CC BY 4.0; code uses the MIT license. See LICENSES.md in the archive for file-level licensing.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Bae, Kyunghan", "affiliation": null}], "version": "1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/qorud02/erdos-295-k18"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23297809"}}]}}, "title": "A 34-term unit-fraction expansion with minimum denominator 18", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23297810", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23297810?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23297810", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297809", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23297809", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23297809", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23297809", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23297810/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23297810/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23297810/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23297810/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/